---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — YouTube Playlist MCP"
  description="Privacy policy for the YouTube Playlist MCP personal tool."
>
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">
    Privacy Policy — YouTube Playlist MCP
  </h1>
  <div class="prose prose-neutral mt-6 max-w-none dark:prose-invert prose-a:text-neutral-900 dark:prose-a:text-neutral-100">
    <p>
      "YouTube Playlist MCP" is a personal, single-user tool built and operated by
      Varshith Regatte. It is not a public product or service.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>What it does:</strong> the application requests read-only access to YouTube
      account data (playlists and playlist items) via the YouTube Data API, using the
      <code>youtube.readonly</code> OAuth scope.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Data use:</strong> data retrieved from the YouTube Data API (video titles,
      links, channel names, and timestamps) is used only within the developer's own
      personal automation tools. It is never sold, shared with third parties, or used
      for advertising.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Data storage:</strong> OAuth credentials are stored only on a private
      server controlled by the developer and are never exposed to any other party.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Single-user scope:</strong> this application is authorized for the
      developer's own Google account only and is not intended for use by anyone else.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Contact:</strong> questions can be sent to
      <a href="mailto:varshith.regatte@gmail.com">varshith.regatte@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
